claim_chart.candidate_text:
Abstract: The utility model discloses a mobile solar drying device, which comprises a photovoltaic power generation unit, a solar drying unit and a solar energy storage unit, wherein the photovoltaic power generation unit consists of a photovoltaic panel, a photovoltaic controller, a storage battery and an inverter; the drying unit is used for drying the materials in the drying chamber by utilizing solar heat; the heat collection unit comprises a heat collection manifold and a plurality of heat collection vacuum tubes, the heat collection manifold is communicated with the plurality of heat collection vacuum tubes, and the heat collection vacuum tubes heat the gas led into the tubes and then convey the gas to the drying unit; the mobile unit comprises a supporting plate, a plurality of idler wheels suitable for moving are arranged below the supporting plate, and the photovoltaic power generation unit, the drying unit and the heat collection unit are all fixed on the upper surface of the supporting plate. The utility model discloses a portable solar drying device has realized solar energy and has united dry all-weather operation, to different weather, different illumination intensity carries out the automatic switch-over of different drying pattern, and is convenient for remove.

Claim 1: 1. A mobile solar drying apparatus, comprising:

Claim 2: the photovoltaic power generation unit consists of a photovoltaic panel, a photovoltaic controller, a storage battery and an inverter and provides electric energy for the mobile solar drying device;

Claim 3: the drying unit is used for drying the materials in the drying chamber by utilizing solar heat;

Claim 4: the heat collection unit comprises a heat collection manifold and a plurality of heat collection vacuum tubes, wherein the upper ends of the plurality of heat collection vacuum tubes are inserted into the heat collection manifold so as to heat the gas flowing through the heat collection manifold;

Claim 5: the mobile unit comprises a supporting plate, a plurality of idler wheels suitable for moving are arranged below the supporting plate, and the photovoltaic power generation unit, the drying unit and the heat collection unit are fixed on the upper surface of the supporting plate.

Claim 6: 2. The mobile solar drying apparatus of claim 1, wherein: the drying unit comprises a thermal circulation fan, a moisture exhaust fan, the drying chamber, an electric heating assembly and a rack; the drying unit is supported and fixed by the rack, the thermal cycle fan is driven by electric energy and is regulated and controlled by the control unit, an air inlet of the thermal cycle fan is connected with an air inlet of the heat collection manifold through a pipeline, an air outlet of the heat collection manifold is connected with an air inlet of the electric heating assembly, and an air outlet of the electric heating assembly is connected with an air inlet of the drying chamber.

